SUMMARY: Our Phones Left Home - Local Children's Book Author Read-Aloud
DESCRIPTION:Sunday\, April 12th!\nJoin us for a read aloud of "Our Phones
  Left Home" by local author John Edwards! This story highlights the impor
 tance of time away from our screens and healthy digital boundaries. We'll
  have kids activities\, live music by Dave Fromer\, and snacks!\n\nWith h
 umor\, warmth\, and irresistible illustrations\, Our Phones Left Home! pl
 ayfully explores digital balance in a way that invites families to redisc
 over the joys of unplugged living. Join Tex\, Phonicia\, and their parent
 s on a laugh-out-loud journey that reminds us that sometimes the best con
 nections don't need Wi-Fi.\n\nTime: 11am - 12pm\nLocation: Usher Gallery\
 , Petaluma
