SUMMARY: Botox\, Chemical Peels & More - Aesthetic Event at Devereux Beau
 ty
DESCRIPTION:Botox\, Chemical Peels & More - Aesthetic Event at Devereux B
 eauty\n\nJoin us for an exclusive aesthetic event featuring Rachel Y.\, a
  registered nurse with 14 years of experience and hundreds of five-star r
 eviews. This event offers a comprehensive menu of premium aesthetic treat
 ments in a convenient\, professional setting.\n\nDate: April 15th\, 2026\
 nTime: 1:30 PM - 4:00 PM\nLocation: Devereux Beauty\, 350 2nd St Suite B\
