 a fun community party along with the art demo.\n\nWhat: Quiet Structure: 
 Live Painting Demo with Roberta Ahrens\n\nWhen: Friday\, April 17th\, 5-8
 pm\n\nLocation: Usher Gallery\, 1 Petaluma Blvd North\, Petaluma\n\nMore 
 information about Quiet Structure\, and featured artist Roberta Ahrens:\n
 \n"Quiet Structure" showcases a selection of contemporary botanical and w
 ater-based works by Roberta Ahrens.\n\nRoberta Ahrens is a California-bas
 ed artist whose practice centers on contemporary works created on handmad
 e cracked linen. This featured exhibition will be on view at Usher Galler
 y from March 24th to April 26th.
