SUMMARY: Saturday Acoustic with Peter Filice at Adobe Road Winery
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a special Saturday acoustic live music set at Ado
 be Road Winery in downtown Petaluma. Sip on award-winning wines while enj
 oying talented local musicians in a warm and inviting atmosphere. Choose 
 from wines by the glass or bottle to discover new favorites. Reserve your
  spot on Tock https://www.exploretock.com/adoberoadwines/ and make it a m
 emorable night of great music\, fine wine\, and good company!\n\nAbout Pe
 ter Filice\n\nA lifelong vocalist and guitar player\, Peter has been in t
 he Bay Area music scene since the 1990’s. He was vocalist and guitarist f
 or the South Bay band OTR\, winners of the KFOX Last Band Standing compet
 ition in 2010\, and subsequently\, in 2015\, started a very successful ac
 oustic act\, P.S. Acoustic Music\, performing in solo\, duo\, and trio fo
 rmats at numerous South Bay venues. He also has performed in tribute show
 s to Creedence Clearwater Revival\, Three Dog Night\, Linda Ronstadt\, an
 d his own Simon and Garfunkel tribute. Having recently relocated to Petal
 uma\, Peter is now performing at many North Bay venues as well as maintai
 ning shows in the South Bay.
CATEGORIES:music,live-music,wine,winery
