SUMMARY: Line Dance Night at Hall of the Above
DESCRIPTION:Ready to kick up your boots and hit the dance floor?⁠\n⁠\nJoi
 n us on First Fridays\, July 3\, for a night of line dancing lessons and 
 open dance. Whether you're a seasoned dancer or stepping onto the floor f
 or the first time\, they'll guide you through every move. ⁠\n\n⏰ Doors ar
 e at 4. Lessons start at 4:15!\n\n👢 Lessons and DJ by Grapevine Dance\n\
 n🎟️ $20 admission—cash or card at the door.\n\n🕺 Kids 12 and under free
 . All skill levels welcome\, no partner required.\n\nSee you on the dance
  floor!
